	<key>readme</key>
	<string>Translator

Uses the built-in macOS translation service. No API keys or Shortcuts needed.

Each keyword of the first Script Filter is a target language: en &lt;text&gt;, zhtw &lt;text&gt;. Add or remove languages by editing its keyword, e.g. en||zhtw||ja||fr. A keyword is a language code (ja, fr) or a language and region (zhtw, zh-cn, engb).

tr &lt;text&gt;: translate into the first keyword language that differs from the text's language.
Universal Action "Translate", or the hotkey once assigned: runs tr on the selected text.

Return copies the translation. Command-Return pastes it into the frontmost app.</string>
